These PawnIO header files are vendored verbatim from the official repository so
this project builds without a network round-trip for the headers:

    Source : https://github.com/namazso/PawnIO.Modules  (include/)
    Author : namazso <admin@namazso.eu>
    License : 0BSD  (SPDX-License-Identifier: 0BSD)  — see the header of each file
    Pinned  : master branch

Files:
    core.inc       Pawn core helpers (tolower, min, max, clamp, ...)
    util.inc       byte/cell packing, FNV hashing, BIT()/SIGN_EXTEND macros
    ntstatus.inc   STATUS_* NTSTATUS constants
    native.inc     the PawnIO native function declarations (MSR, PCI, I/O, ...)
    extra.inc      Windows/PawnIO helpers (get_cpu_vendor, get_cpu_fms, ...)
    pawnio.inc     umbrella include + the DEFINE_IOCTL / DEFINE_IOCTL_SIZED macros

To refresh them to the latest upstream:
    ./scripts/refresh-headers.sh

If you contribute a module upstream, build against the upstream include/ dir
instead of this vendored copy so you track any header changes.
